expression: "snap(ErrorKind::Archived\n{ slug: \"perf3ct/gea\".into(), host: \"git.example.org\".into() }, c)"
---
error: perf3ct/gea is archived and read-only (HTTP 423)

  request:    POST /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/gea/issues
  repository: perf3ct/gea

what to do:
  archived repositories are read-only.
  1. unarchive it at https://git.example.org/perf3ct/gea/settings
  2. then run the command again
  reads still work: gea issue list -R perf3ct/gea
